  "description": "This 12\" youth bike is perfect for young riders aged 3 and up. It features a lightweight, durable steel frame, 12” rubber wheels for a smooth ride, tool-free training wheels/pedals, and an adjustable seat to grow with your child. Bright Nishiki decals add a fun finishing touch.\n\nFeatures:\n\nIdeal for young riders ages 4-6 learning how to ride a bike\n\nFits riders 3'1\"-3'8\" tall with a 15\"-19\" inseam\n\nDurable steel frame with coaster brakes for reliable stopping power\n\nLow step-through design makes it easy for young riders\n\nLow-maintenance 16\" rubber tires provide great traction and control for confident riding on sidewalks and paved paths\n\nTool-free adjustable seat post for growing kids\n\nEasy assembly, no tools needed! Training wheels, seat post, and quick-deploy pedals all attach in minutes\n\nComfortable seat and easy-to-reach handlebars\n\nReflectors on the front and back for added safety\n\nBike weighs approximately 20 lbs.",
